+// noc_panel_hit — is the pointer over the panel plate? The wheel-ownership
+// check (v2-camera-zoom): the NOC drop log scrolls ONLY while the pointer is
+// over the panel; anywhere else the wheel zooms the map. The panel is the
+// whole scrollable column (the r1 scroll-clamp surface).
+noc_panel_hit :: proc(pos: rl.Vector2) -> bool {
+	return pos.x >= NOC_PANEL_X && pos.x < NOC_PANEL_X + NOC_PANEL_W &&
+		pos.y >= NOC_PANEL_Y && pos.y < NOC_PANEL_Y + NOC_PANEL_H
+}
